Report the advisory collector extraction readiness checklist. The output is informational: it never moves code or changes runtime behavior. With no argument it lists every collector family the extraction policy tracks; with a family argument it explains that single family's per-criterion checklist.

Usage:
  eshu component extraction-readiness [collector-family] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for extraction-readiness
      --json      Emit machine-readable JSON
      --verbose   Show every criterion, not just blockers

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
